1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 12]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:02:00,070 --> 00:02:01,180
I gathered everyone today

4
00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:03,130
to discuss something.

5
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,020
I'll cut to the chase.

6
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:08,100
The Otherworld Tower is under the military hospital.

7
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,570
I'm sure all of you are already aware of it.

8
00:02:11,710 --> 00:02:14,820
I investigated it with Tiezui and Laogou.

9
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:17,410
We encountered many inexplicable events.

10
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:20,130
But most importantly,

11
00:02:21,910 --> 00:02:22,730
we discovered

12
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:24,850
Japanese activities underneath.

13
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:28,500
Their leader is none other than Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

14
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,450
On the surface, he is a merchant.

15
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:32,890
In reality,

16
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,850
he's a technical expert

17
00:02:35,310 --> 00:02:36,170
from Japan.

18
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:38,450
He and his men

19
00:02:38,990 --> 00:02:40,660
went underneath Changsha

20
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,260
in search of an item.

21
00:02:44,910 --> 00:02:46,170
As for what it is,

22
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:47,780
we don't know yet.

23
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,340
But given his identity,

24
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,010
it must have something to do with the war.

25
00:02:52,910 --> 00:02:54,950
So Master Zhang, you went down,

26
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,450
failed to capture the Japanese,

27
00:02:56,820 --> 00:02:58,890
and allowed them to kidnap Laogou

28
00:02:59,190 --> 00:03:00,660
right under your nose instead.

29
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:03,890
I was told

30
00:03:04,910 --> 00:03:05,940
that when you guys descended,

31
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,340
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama was already dead.

32
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,890
But you performed some rituals

33
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:11,730
and resurrected him.

34
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:13,820
Is that right, Tiezui?

35
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:16,290
It's

36
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,410
really inexplicable.

37
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:22,820
You don't believe it, Master Zhang?

38
00:03:23,030 --> 00:03:23,820
No.

39
00:03:25,150 --> 00:03:26,220
It's all a trick.

40
00:03:26,710 --> 00:03:28,450
We just haven't figured it out yet.

41
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:31,170
I don't believe in resurrection either.

42
00:03:31,590 --> 00:03:34,100
However, I might have a plausible explanation.

43
00:03:34,710 --> 00:03:36,340
Master Zhang, you said

44
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:38,260
you went down with Laogou and Tiezui.

45
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,130
You forgot someone.

46
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,570
I heard

47
00:03:44,030 --> 00:03:45,730
that Miss Huo joined you too.

48
00:03:50,590 --> 00:03:53,060
The Huo Clan is now just a shell of its former self.

49
00:03:53,430 --> 00:03:54,540
It has no money

50
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:55,640
or manpower.

51
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:57,100
It can't survive in Mystic Nine anymore.

52
00:03:57,430 --> 00:03:58,010
Master Zhang,

53
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,850
why did you bring the Huo Clan with you?

54
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:03,570
What's in it for you?

55
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,170
Not the Huo Clan.

56
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:08,010
Just Xiangu.

57
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,290
Isn't that odd?

58
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,850
Unless...

59
00:04:19,530 --> 00:04:21,730
Unless you fancy Xiangu.

60
00:04:23,270 --> 00:04:24,810
To revitalize the Huo Clan,

61
00:04:24,870 --> 00:04:26,220
you lured Laogou underground

62
00:04:26,660 --> 00:04:28,020
and killed him with her.

63
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,340
Then, you made up a story

64
00:04:29,510 --> 00:04:31,410
of the resurrection of the Japanese

65
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,340
to fool us.

66
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,520
Once the whole thing is over,

67
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:35,610
you'll give Laogou's property to Xiangu.

68
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:45,900
Chen Pi, you're also a traitor.

69
00:04:46,310 --> 00:04:48,490
Open your mouth again and I'll kill you.

70
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:49,930
Was I wrong though?

71
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,170
Your clan nominated you as the head

72
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,610
because you can make them money.

73
00:04:54,070 --> 00:04:54,810
Listen.

74
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,140
Sleeping with Master Zhang

75
00:04:56,290 --> 00:04:57,220
is a good deal.

76
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,140
Shut up, Chen Pi.

77
00:04:58,750 --> 00:04:59,980
What are you on about?

78
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:02,540
Master Zhang didn't know Laogou went down.

79
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:05,660
I gave the order to Xiangu to descend.

80
00:05:09,190 --> 00:05:10,250
Does anyone have any comments?

81
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,730
It was also my advice to Master Zhang.

82
00:05:18,390 --> 00:05:19,370
Miss Huo

83
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:20,930
can hang upside down and descend into a salt mine.

84
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:24,050
She can be useful when the situation calls for it.

85
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:25,340
- She can be useful? Then I...
- Chen Pi.

86
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:26,730
Enough.

87
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,930
I don't care about Laogou's life anyway.

88
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,460
The

89
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,850
Otherworld Tower has collapsed,

90
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,140
and the Japanese are gone.

91
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:48,810
All we lost was a dog.

92
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,780
I know someone called Donkey.

93
00:05:51,270 --> 00:05:52,580
Perhaps we can promote him.

94
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,170
Or, let's just do it now

95
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,410
and share Laogou's property.

96
00:05:56,630 --> 00:05:57,980
The Mystic Nine will become the Mystic Eight.

97
00:05:58,190 --> 00:05:58,610
Deal?

98
00:05:59,310 --> 00:06:01,140
I'll get money? Sure.

99
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:03,900
30 years.

100
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,580
30 years ago,

101
00:06:10,190 --> 00:06:11,930
when the Eight-Nation Alliance attacked Beiping,

102
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,930
the royalty was too busy fighting among themselves for power.

103
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:17,610
And now,

104
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:21,170
is any of them still alive?

105
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:26,370
The Japanese covet Northeastern China.

106
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:29,050
Dandong might fall anytime soon.

107
00:06:30,150 --> 00:06:30,840
You think

108
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:32,490
Changsha will remain unscathed?

109
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,780
The Japanese

110
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,660
lie in wait in the tower for many years.

111
00:06:38,430 --> 00:06:39,340
Laogou was kidnapped.

112
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,170
This is not a coincidence.

113
00:06:42,310 --> 00:06:43,410
They wanted this to happen.

114
00:06:43,950 --> 00:06:45,730
They must have a plan.

115
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,410
If we don't work together to fight back now,

116
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:49,840
when the Japanese

117
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,610
assemble their grenade launchers underneath this city,

118
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,140
do you think they have the patience to negotiate

119
00:06:53,190 --> 00:06:54,170
the distribution of land with us?

120
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:57,930
Listen up.

121
00:06:58,430 --> 00:06:59,370
None of us

122
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,410
will be spared, let alone the Mystic Nine.

123
00:07:08,230 --> 00:07:08,870
Master Zhang.

124
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,980
What do you want us to do now?

125
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,170
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

126
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:19,250
and Laogou are probably not in Changsha right now.

127
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:21,100
I have no jurisdiction to mobilize the soldiers outside the city.

128
00:07:21,950 --> 00:07:23,100
I need your merchants,

129
00:07:23,830 --> 00:07:24,490
informants,

130
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,140
and spies to find them for me.

131
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:27,850
Noted.

132
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:31,370
The Hong Clan will mobilize some men.

133
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:35,170
I think the Japanese merely

134
00:07:35,190 --> 00:07:36,460
took Laogou hostage.

135
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,220
Impossible.

136
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,730
They planned carefully

137
00:07:39,950 --> 00:07:41,460
to lure us down there for Laogou.

138
00:07:42,630 --> 00:07:44,370
If their target is Laogou,

139
00:07:45,070 --> 00:07:46,700
what about him

140
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:49,410
piques the Japanese's interest?

141
00:07:49,830 --> 00:07:52,460
Laogou is good at taming animals.

142
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,610
He tames dogs and birds

143
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:56,490
to deliver messages.

144
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,420
But the Japanese did not take dogs

145
00:07:58,420 --> 00:07:59,370
or birds with them.

146
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:00,870
[Map of the Otherworld Tower]

147
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:02,140
Perhaps they want

148
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,810
Laogou's talent for taming beasts.

149
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:05,610
What?

150
00:08:06,390 --> 00:08:09,340
Are the Japanese assembling an army of dogs

151
00:08:09,430 --> 00:08:10,410
or birds?

152
00:08:12,070 --> 00:08:13,540
Laogou's dogs are fierce,

153
00:08:13,950 --> 00:08:15,170
but they are not war-ready.

154
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,220
What do the Japanese want?

155
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:23,780
I see it now.

156
00:08:26,430 --> 00:08:28,540
Laogou is a Japanese sympathizer.

157
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,020
He went down with you

158
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,300
to save the Japanese.

159
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,980
That's why he resurrected them.

160
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,700
Impossible.

161
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:38,890
I know how they left.

162
00:08:40,510 --> 00:08:41,300
Master Zhang,

163
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:44,820
you said the tower was under the military hospital.

164
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,270
There is an underground stream.

165
00:08:50,270 --> 00:08:51,750
[Waterway]

166
00:08:51,750 --> 00:08:53,600
If they didn't leave through the front door,

167
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,220
the only alternative

168
00:08:56,030 --> 00:08:57,130
is the underground stream.

169
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,460
[Liunian Hall A]
Third Master, you know the underground streams

170
00:09:03,630 --> 00:09:04,370
of Changsha well.

171
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,010
I need to know how the Japanese left.

172
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:09,820
Please show us the way.

173
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:10,850
Sure.

174
00:09:13,670 --> 00:09:15,100
For our future,

175
00:09:15,870 --> 00:09:17,370
I shall come with you.

176
00:09:22,510 --> 00:09:23,580
Thank you, everyone.

177
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:40,010
Xiangu.

178
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:42,700
Stay here.

179
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,490
I need your help for something.

180
00:09:46,750 --> 00:09:47,180
Okay.

181
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:55,010
Do you want me to deal with Huo Wenhai?

182
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,300
No need, Master Zhang.

183
00:09:56,790 --> 00:09:57,580
I know what I'm doing.

184
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,370
Having his attention

185
00:09:59,630 --> 00:10:00,490
is not necessarily a bad thing.

186
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,650
Without a flaw,

187
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,180
we can't keep him contained.

188
00:10:04,790 --> 00:10:06,010
I should be the one to hold his attention.

189
00:10:06,670 --> 00:10:07,460
I can keep myself safe.

190
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:09,850
Be careful.

191
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:10,730
Worry not, Master Zhang.

192
00:10:38,750 --> 00:10:40,130
Who told you to enter the Otherworld Tower?

193
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:42,610
Down there, we discovered

194
00:10:42,670 --> 00:10:44,700
that someone had been dropping supplies for the Japanese.

195
00:10:45,750 --> 00:10:47,340
It should be the same person who asked you

196
00:10:47,550 --> 00:10:48,370
to enter the tower.

197
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:50,180
Who is it?

198
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,220
Ding Qiansui.

199
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:55,610
What did he ask you to do?

200
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,060
He wanted me to explore the place

201
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,420
and leave markings for him.

202
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:02,700
I suppose he wanted to enter the tower too.

203
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:04,820
However,

204
00:11:08,670 --> 00:11:09,490
I found

205
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:11,490
many supplies for the Japanese down there.

206
00:11:11,910 --> 00:11:13,940
I recognize some of them.

207
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,220
They were supplies Ding Qiansui

208
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,420
had asked my clan to purchase.

209
00:11:18,150 --> 00:11:19,490
That was when I noticed

210
00:11:19,910 --> 00:11:21,220
that he had been working with the Japanese.

211
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:23,010
And now, my clan is implicated.

212
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,890
You entered the ponds before we did.

213
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:28,940
What did you do?

214
00:11:35,910 --> 00:11:37,180
I'm sick of being used.

215
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:41,130
So I need to find out the truth as soon as possible.

216
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,850
I want to know what the Japanese are up to,

217
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,010
and what Ding Qiansui

218
00:11:46,790 --> 00:11:48,060
is plotting.

219
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:50,180
That way, I can act pre-emptively,

220
00:11:51,550 --> 00:11:53,060
instead of being someone's pawn.

221
00:12:00,790 --> 00:12:02,420
If you don't believe me, Master Zhang,

222
00:12:04,030 --> 00:12:05,300
you can raid my clan,

223
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,980
or lock me up for interrogation.

224
00:12:09,630 --> 00:12:10,770
I defended you just now

225
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:13,130
because I'm not sure if you're our enemy.

226
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:14,940
You went to the Otherworld Tower alone.

227
00:12:15,030 --> 00:12:16,010
Once this becomes public,

228
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,100
I'll have to punish you

229
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,300
according to the military rules.

230
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,580
If this happens again,

231
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:22,460
I will show no mercy,

232
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:23,940
regardless of your excuse.

233
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:27,100
Go now.

234
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,250
I still need your help

235
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:31,940
regarding Laogou.

236
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:50,940
Spill it.

237
00:12:56,510 --> 00:12:56,980
Master Zhang,

238
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,850
I might

239
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:00,010
have a lead.

240
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:03,850
After Laogou and you went into the ponds,

241
00:13:04,670 --> 00:13:06,300
we found a photo among

242
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,010
the Japanese documents.

243
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:09,820
The photo

244
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,980
depicts a statue of the Otherworld Patriarch

245
00:13:12,030 --> 00:13:13,250
woven with hair.

246
00:13:14,270 --> 00:13:14,980
As you know,

247
00:13:15,630 --> 00:13:18,010
not many people in this world

248
00:13:18,150 --> 00:13:19,460
have voluminous hair.

249
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,530
Coincidentally,

250
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,530
I know of such a person.

251
00:13:24,390 --> 00:13:26,850
At first, I thought it was just a pure coincidence.

252
00:13:27,510 --> 00:13:28,370
But after I came out,

253
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:30,980
it continued to puzzle me.

254
00:13:33,510 --> 00:13:34,420
Who is she?

255
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:38,300
She was a female customer who came to my father's stall

256
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,700
for a divination a long time ago.

257
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,610
She had really long hair.

258
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:43,700
But

259
00:13:43,810 --> 00:13:45,370
I have never seen her since

260
00:13:46,230 --> 00:13:47,820
and I don't know where she is now.

261
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,420
But don't worry, Master Zhang.

262
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:52,890
This

263
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,060
can be a lead.

264
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,060
I'll follow up with it.

265
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:57,370
Be quick.

266
00:13:58,390 --> 00:13:58,890
Sure.

267
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,250
Now.

268
00:14:03,630 --> 00:14:04,650
Sure, Master Zhang.

269
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,130
Goodbye.

270
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:20,250
Master,

271
00:14:21,030 --> 00:14:22,530
so it was all Ding Qiansui's doing.

272
00:14:22,910 --> 00:14:23,980
But isn't he a eunuch?

273
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:26,770
Why is he working with the Japanese?

274
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,370
Not just the Japanese.

275
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:31,220
He prospers in Changsha

276
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:32,850
because he has support

277
00:14:32,870 --> 00:14:34,100
from the Americans.

278
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,340
Americans too?

279
00:14:36,910 --> 00:14:38,420
His background is enigmatic.

280
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:41,010
He probably is working with the Japanese

281
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:42,340
and the Americans together.

282
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:43,660
Getting rid of him

283
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:45,330
won't be easy.

284
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:49,690
Xiaoyu, Xiaojin.

285
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:50,460
Yes.

286
00:14:50,710 --> 00:14:52,770
Investigate Ding Qiansui.

287
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:54,300
I want

288
00:14:55,510 --> 00:14:56,620
to eradicate him.

289
00:14:56,870 --> 00:14:57,330
Yes.

290
00:15:13,150 --> 00:15:14,130
Officer Huo, you're awake.

291
00:15:22,390 --> 00:15:23,290
Where is the Mystic Nine?

292
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:25,610
Officer Huo, you have a misunderstanding.

293
00:15:26,990 --> 00:15:28,730
You saw the Mystic Nine just now.

294
00:15:28,750 --> 00:15:29,780
In a surge of emotion,

295
00:15:30,070 --> 00:15:31,260
you passed out.

296
00:15:33,710 --> 00:15:35,050
Don't take me for a fool.

297
00:15:35,710 --> 00:15:37,680
You trespassed into military ground,

298
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:38,500
and attacked an officer.

299
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:39,440
By right, I can have all of you

300
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,540
executed.

301
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:46,010
Officer Huo.

302
00:15:46,630 --> 00:15:49,050
The Mystic Nine heard that I was sick,

303
00:15:49,350 --> 00:15:51,050
so they rushed here to check on me.

304
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:53,620
They didn't know you had imprisoned me.

305
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:57,340
Nonsense! My people are by the entrance.

306
00:15:57,340 --> 00:15:58,420
They are not blind.

307
00:16:00,910 --> 00:16:02,170
Wasn't Zhang Qishan here?

308
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:03,290
Bring him over.

309
00:16:03,370 --> 00:16:04,370
I want to talk to him.

310
00:16:09,460 --> 00:16:10,780
Master Zhang was here.

311
00:16:11,550 --> 00:16:12,810
He saw that everyone barged in unlawfully

312
00:16:12,830 --> 00:16:14,060
and lectured everyone.

313
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:17,580
He asked all of them to reflect upon themselves.

314
00:16:18,550 --> 00:16:19,760
He too wanted to punish

315
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:21,450
the guards for their oversight.

316
00:16:22,550 --> 00:16:23,450
But

317
00:16:24,670 --> 00:16:25,980
since they are your soldiers,

318
00:16:26,550 --> 00:16:27,980
he didn't want to go over your head.

319
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:30,890
So he asked me to tell you

320
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:34,010
to deal with them accordingly.

321
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:35,810
I have

322
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:36,780
delivered the message to you.

323
00:16:36,910 --> 00:16:38,290
I feel unwell.

324
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:39,980
Allow me to rest first.

325
00:16:44,550 --> 00:16:45,170
Officer Huo.

326
00:16:45,910 --> 00:16:46,700
Do

327
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,530
relax yourself if you can.

328
00:16:49,470 --> 00:16:51,340
It will be bad

329
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,580
if you fall sick in the future because of this.

330
00:16:59,110 --> 00:16:59,730
You...

331
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:09,180
[Divination Service]

332
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:16,900
After we entered the Otherworld Tower,

333
00:17:17,110 --> 00:17:18,500
we found a statue with hair

334
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:20,620
by the corner of the main passage.

335
00:17:20,870 --> 00:17:23,020
The statue was around 170cm in height

336
00:17:23,110 --> 00:17:24,530
and looked like a living person.

337
00:17:25,110 --> 00:17:27,810
The hair used to make a statue

338
00:17:27,990 --> 00:17:29,090
is quite rare.

339
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:33,180
Send the deceased off with no regrets.

340
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:36,690
For the living and the lives.

341
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:39,940
For the living and the lives.

342
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:44,180
No more regrets, no more resentment.

343
00:17:44,670 --> 00:17:47,970
No more regrets, no more resentment.

344
00:17:50,110 --> 00:17:52,810
A mystic once claimed

345
00:17:53,390 --> 00:17:55,810
that the woman encountered the Otherworld Patriarch's sermon

346
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:58,090
and decided to join him.

347
00:17:58,960 --> 00:17:59,970
Interestingly,

348
00:18:00,270 --> 00:18:02,460
the followers were donned in ancient attire.

349
00:18:02,710 --> 00:18:05,410
Their hair and accessories were not from the contemporary time.

350
00:18:05,710 --> 00:18:08,250
They dressed as the Otherworld Patriarch did.

351
00:18:08,830 --> 00:18:10,460
Further investigation

352
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,850
[Xishan]
alleged that the hair maiden

353
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:15,570
last appeared in a monastery in Xishan.

354
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,650
Our men went there many times

355
00:18:18,110 --> 00:18:20,970
but due to geographical and manpower restraints,

356
00:18:21,480 --> 00:18:23,810
we were unable to confirm where they went.

357
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:26,900
[Xishan]
This lead would be held off for now

358
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:30,530
until we obtained more resources.

359
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:41,020
This fate is doomed.

360
00:18:41,710 --> 00:18:43,060
There is no escaping it.

361
00:18:47,270 --> 00:18:49,020
[Alter Your Fate]
But if I risk my life for this lead,

362
00:18:50,150 --> 00:18:51,650
I might just get us

363
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:54,250
a lifeline.

364
00:19:06,030 --> 00:19:06,540
Sir.

365
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,660
Zhang Qishan allowed the Mystic Nine to trespass into Xie Residence

366
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:11,250
for

367
00:19:11,270 --> 00:19:12,060
a meeting.

368
00:19:12,320 --> 00:19:13,770
He has no respect for the military rules.

369
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,610
According to Bandits Punishment Regulations

370
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:17,500
and Section 32 of Army Punishment Regulations,

371
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:19,100
the Mystic Nine and Zhang Qishan...

372
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:20,770
Yes, I know.

373
00:19:20,770 --> 00:19:21,360
[Yang Jian]

374
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:22,390
[Central China Disciplinary Commissioner]
The higher up will deal with it.

375
00:19:23,070 --> 00:19:23,610
Sir,

376
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:26,420
Zhang Qishan is obviously working

377
00:19:26,470 --> 00:19:27,940
with the Mystic Nine.

378
00:19:28,150 --> 00:19:30,530
But the city defense requires Zhang Qishan.

379
00:19:31,120 --> 00:19:33,130
If you're unhappy with the decision of the Ministry of War,

380
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:35,420
making a call won't do it.

381
00:19:47,030 --> 00:19:47,570
Sir.

382
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:49,860
Huo Wenhai called again

383
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:51,490
to complain about Zhang Qishan.

384
00:19:51,660 --> 00:19:52,790
[Luo Ang, Special Forces Director]

385
00:19:52,790 --> 00:19:54,050
The Ministry of War

386
00:19:54,350 --> 00:19:55,490
wants to get rid of gangsterism.

387
00:19:56,510 --> 00:19:58,530
But the Mystic Nine

388
00:19:59,030 --> 00:20:01,090
always gets extra leeway.

389
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:04,380
Is it because of Zhang Qishan?

390
00:20:05,270 --> 00:20:06,380
I recruited him

391
00:20:06,790 --> 00:20:07,980
personally back then.

392
00:20:09,550 --> 00:20:10,620
He carried me

393
00:20:11,550 --> 00:20:13,460
from the pile of dead bodies on the battlefield

394
00:20:13,790 --> 00:20:14,570
and saved me.

395
00:20:16,550 --> 00:20:18,010
My bond with Qishan

396
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,900
goes beyond a few sentences.

397
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:24,090
Are you going to spare the Mystic Nine?

398
00:20:26,550 --> 00:20:27,460
There's no running away.

399
00:20:30,110 --> 00:20:31,140
It's a national matter.

400
00:20:31,590 --> 00:20:34,220
Time to settle the score.

401
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:55,380
Huo Wenhai is gone.

402
00:20:59,910 --> 00:21:02,250
Of course, he left after a chat.

403
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,730
What brought you to my prison, Fourth Master?

404
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:06,980
I wouldn't want you to contact my rotten luck.

405
00:21:08,550 --> 00:21:10,010
Fresh crabs from the Xiang River.

406
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:11,090
Each weighs ten liang.

407
00:21:11,750 --> 00:21:13,220
I already gave some to the others in Mystic Nine.

408
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:14,490
It's tough to get to you

409
00:21:15,350 --> 00:21:16,770
so I came in person.

410
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,530
You love crabs.

411
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:21,290
You'll be brokenhearted if you can't have them.

412
00:21:28,070 --> 00:21:29,700
You had a wager with Li

413
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:31,220
when you joined the Mystic Nine.

414
00:21:31,750 --> 00:21:32,620
I see you still remember it.

415
00:21:33,550 --> 00:21:35,140
That's why you give us crabs every year.

416
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:36,330
You never once forget it.

417
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:37,700
Your integrity

418
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:39,700
sure is outstanding.

419
00:21:40,790 --> 00:21:41,700
Of course.

420
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:43,490
People don't like me.

421
00:21:43,550 --> 00:21:45,380
If I don't have a talent,

422
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:46,420
how can I survive in this world?

423
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,900
Once I make a promise,

424
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:51,090
no one can break it.

425
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,290
But that doesn't mean you should tell everyone

426
00:21:53,310 --> 00:21:54,460
that I love crabs.

427
00:21:55,070 --> 00:21:57,010
When you bring them every year, you'll say I love them.

428
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:59,090
Is it because my family name

429
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:00,090
is a homophone of crabs?

430
00:22:01,310 --> 00:22:02,090
Whatever.

431
00:22:02,110 --> 00:22:03,010
Just do whatever you want.

432
00:22:05,880 --> 00:22:07,810
Isn't it boring to be stuck in here?

433
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:12,290
As you age,

434
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:14,620
you realize that being able to sit in peace

435
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:16,900
is also a kind of blessing.

436
00:22:17,920 --> 00:22:19,730
I can find a way to get you out of here.

437
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:21,570
So long as you don't stay in Changsha.

438
00:22:23,270 --> 00:22:24,180
Why don't you work for me?

439
00:22:24,680 --> 00:22:25,980
It'll be more fun than where you are right now.

440
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:29,010
Clearing my name

441
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:29,770
is easy.

442
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:32,900
But as long as I'm part of the Mystic Nine,

443
00:22:34,030 --> 00:22:35,730
I will still suffer the same fate.

444
00:22:36,030 --> 00:22:36,460
Oh?

445
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:39,700
And I thought I was the only one in the Mystic Nine

446
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:42,330
to know that things would not end well for us.

447
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:44,090
The Mystic Nine exists

448
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:45,810
for a good reason.

449
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:47,140
But this reason

450
00:22:48,920 --> 00:22:50,530
will not exist forever.

451
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:52,810
When the world is in turmoil,

452
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:53,940
society is in chaos.

453
00:22:55,060 --> 00:22:56,380
Our leaders are busy fighting wars,

454
00:22:57,550 --> 00:22:59,420
while the people can hardly fill their tummies.

455
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:01,090
Without the restraint of power,

456
00:23:01,310 --> 00:23:02,900
an interim system of governance appeared

457
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:04,050
among the people.

458
00:23:04,510 --> 00:23:05,380
The Mystic Nine

459
00:23:07,270 --> 00:23:09,180
was born out of necessity.

460
00:23:09,920 --> 00:23:11,700
We're not the good people,

461
00:23:12,030 --> 00:23:14,380
but we give the poor a way to live.

462
00:23:15,550 --> 00:23:18,460
Now that a new order has been established,

463
00:23:18,750 --> 00:23:20,330
the foundation on which the Mystic Nine was built

464
00:23:20,350 --> 00:23:21,490
has collapsed.

465
00:23:21,790 --> 00:23:22,700
In this world,

466
00:23:23,840 --> 00:23:25,650
grassroots organizations like the Mystic Nine

467
00:23:25,650 --> 00:23:26,530
are not only redundant,

468
00:23:27,270 --> 00:23:29,560
but also a threat to be uprooted.

469
00:23:30,070 --> 00:23:32,220
Relics of the past will be gone eventually.

470
00:23:33,070 --> 00:23:34,050
No point lamenting it.

471
00:23:37,550 --> 00:23:40,010
Why not just protect yourself first?

472
00:23:41,830 --> 00:23:44,090
I can kill Huo Wenhai for you.

473
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:46,730
As usual, 100 wen and we have a deal.

474
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,380
If my clan wants to come out unscathed,

475
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:52,220
it cannot do it alone.

476
00:23:52,750 --> 00:23:54,730
The Mystic Nine is in the same boat.

477
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:56,620
If the higher-up doesn't want the Mystic Nine anymore,

478
00:23:56,750 --> 00:23:58,290
they will get rid of us.

479
00:23:58,640 --> 00:24:00,180
That's why they sent Huo Wenhai here.

480
00:24:00,480 --> 00:24:01,810
He was part of the Mystic Nine.

481
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:04,140
He knows the Mystic Nine well.

482
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:06,050
If he wants to climb,

483
00:24:06,200 --> 00:24:07,420
he needs to prove

484
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:09,490
that he has severed ties with the Mystic Nine.

485
00:24:09,830 --> 00:24:11,330
He won't show mercy.

486
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:13,460
He will use everything he can

487
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:14,530
to get rid of the Mystic Nine.

488
00:24:14,880 --> 00:24:16,380
Once the Ministry of War gets rid of the Mystic Nine,

489
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:18,620
it'll be a transformative event.

490
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:20,050
If one Huo Wenhai can't do it,

491
00:24:20,310 --> 00:24:20,940
they'll send ten.

492
00:24:21,270 --> 00:24:22,730
If not, a thousand

493
00:24:22,960 --> 00:24:23,660
or ten thousand.

494
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:26,010
The Mystic Nine is destined to fall.

495
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:29,530
You and I can't escape from it.

496
00:24:30,790 --> 00:24:32,330
Since you already know that,

497
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:34,010
why can't you let go of it?

498
00:24:34,750 --> 00:24:36,220
Yes, I already know

499
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:38,250
that the Mystic Nine will fall.

500
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:39,490
But we

501
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:42,330
have a new variable now.

502
00:24:46,310 --> 00:24:47,090
What is it?

503
00:24:49,750 --> 00:24:50,490
Fifth Master.

504
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:52,620
Wu Laogou.

505
00:24:55,860 --> 00:24:59,100
[Caopan Mountain]

506
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:13,050
You're awake.

507
00:25:28,880 --> 00:25:30,250
Don't ask me where you are.

508
00:25:31,030 --> 00:25:32,050
Just know that

509
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,460
you can't get out.

510
00:25:35,770 --> 00:25:36,940
You came back to life.

511
00:25:38,110 --> 00:25:39,090
Are you a human or a ghost?

512
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:41,770
No one can come back to life in this world.

513
00:25:42,350 --> 00:25:43,460
But I saw it myself.

514
00:25:45,880 --> 00:25:46,660
Guess then.

515
00:25:47,310 --> 00:25:49,140
You have all the time in the world.

516
00:25:50,510 --> 00:25:52,010
How did we pull that off?

517
00:25:58,550 --> 00:25:59,980
Anyone else would have assumed

518
00:26:00,830 --> 00:26:02,090
that it was a spell.

519
00:26:11,830 --> 00:26:12,420
Yes.

520
00:26:13,680 --> 00:26:15,090
That's what is so great

521
00:26:15,510 --> 00:26:16,770
about the Chinese.

522
00:26:17,030 --> 00:26:18,860
No, I mean your ancestors.

523
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:20,700
Not the modern Chinese.

524
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:23,040
During my first two years in the tower,

525
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:24,620
I too thought spells were real.

526
00:26:25,070 --> 00:26:26,460
I was as shocked as you are.

527
00:26:26,750 --> 00:26:27,730
But spells

528
00:26:29,830 --> 00:26:31,010
don't exist in this world.

529
00:26:32,030 --> 00:26:33,490
So you're saying what I've experienced

530
00:26:34,720 --> 00:26:35,900
is just an illusion.

531
00:26:40,160 --> 00:26:40,810
Not an illusion.

532
00:26:41,030 --> 00:26:42,250
But not a spell either.

533
00:26:42,750 --> 00:26:43,660
It's technology.

534
00:26:44,350 --> 00:26:46,490
A wondrous technology.

535
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:53,810
Technology?

536
00:26:54,550 --> 00:26:55,050
Yes.

537
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:58,380
Your ancestors several millennia ago

538
00:26:58,440 --> 00:27:00,490
mastered this technology.

539
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:03,250
But the Chinese now

540
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:04,860
do not know it.

541
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:06,050
You think it's spells.

542
00:27:08,270 --> 00:27:09,330
You scoundrel.

543
00:27:10,590 --> 00:27:11,860
What are you on about?

544
00:27:12,270 --> 00:27:13,330
You don't need to know.

545
00:27:24,240 --> 00:27:25,380
Stand up, Fifth Master.

546
00:27:26,310 --> 00:27:27,090
Come. Fifth Master.

547
00:27:28,720 --> 00:27:29,250
Fifth Master.

548
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:31,900
I brought you here

549
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:33,810
to help me tame

550
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:34,900
a special animal.

551
00:27:36,310 --> 00:27:37,050
I'll count on you.

552
00:27:38,750 --> 00:27:39,860
Without it,

553
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:43,860
I can proceed with my next plan.

554
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:45,620
No, I refuse.

555
00:27:52,590 --> 00:27:54,730
I have Unit 401 now.

556
00:27:57,510 --> 00:27:59,620
The Unit 401 Zhang Qishan asked you

557
00:27:59,720 --> 00:28:00,940
to find.

558
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:04,010
If you won't help me,

559
00:28:04,790 --> 00:28:08,330
I'll kill them one by one.

560
00:28:09,350 --> 00:28:09,940
When that happens,

561
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,610
your promise to Zhang Qishan

562
00:28:11,610 --> 00:28:12,730
can never be delivered.

563
00:28:13,350 --> 00:28:15,980
And your wish will never come true.

564
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:19,420
When a soldier steps on the battlefield,

565
00:28:20,830 --> 00:28:22,290
he is prepared to sacrifice his life.

566
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:24,420
I'm a bandit,

567
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:26,570
but I share the same sentiment.

568
00:28:36,160 --> 00:28:37,010
No.

569
00:28:37,880 --> 00:28:38,900
I beg to differ.

570
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:41,050
In my research,

571
00:28:41,440 --> 00:28:44,810
soldiers and bandits are not the same thing.

572
00:28:45,070 --> 00:28:46,490
Piss a bandit off

573
00:28:47,110 --> 00:28:48,940
and they might kill your emperor.

574
00:28:58,270 --> 00:28:59,290
Fifth Master,

575
00:29:02,550 --> 00:29:04,700
let me share a story with you.

576
00:29:06,270 --> 00:29:09,220
It'll answer your questions.

577
00:29:10,200 --> 00:29:13,050
Four years ago, I entered the Otherworld Tower in Changsha

578
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:15,620
to find out the secret of Yin Changsheng.

579
00:29:16,480 --> 00:29:17,980
I was stuck underground

580
00:29:18,070 --> 00:29:19,330
for three years.

581
00:29:20,310 --> 00:29:21,560
Until the first parasite

582
00:29:21,560 --> 00:29:23,230
[Torii Totori, Hatoyama's Superior]
among you appeared.

583
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:25,700
Things finally took a turn for the better.

584
00:29:26,530 --> 00:29:28,510
I thought with enough money,

585
00:29:28,590 --> 00:29:30,420
this problem would be solved.

586
00:29:30,750 --> 00:29:32,530
After all, humans are greedy.

587
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:35,420
To my dismay,

588
00:29:36,590 --> 00:29:38,620
after spending so much time,

589
00:29:38,640 --> 00:29:40,980
they only found Ding Qiansui.

590
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:43,980
He took his time

591
00:29:44,030 --> 00:29:46,140
to leverage the Huo Clan.

592
00:29:47,030 --> 00:29:49,180
But by then, we almost

593
00:29:49,200 --> 00:29:50,620
starved to death.

594
00:29:50,680 --> 00:29:52,620
We almost gave up.

595
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:56,420
Ding Qiansui took our funds

596
00:29:57,400 --> 00:29:59,140
and bought the Huo Clan.

597
00:30:00,750 --> 00:30:04,980
If your clan wants to remain in the Mystic Nine,

598
00:30:06,160 --> 00:30:09,860
you'll need help.

599
00:30:10,720 --> 00:30:12,050
I have the money

600
00:30:13,830 --> 00:30:16,010
and the connections.

601
00:30:17,310 --> 00:30:21,420
But you'll need to help me out too.

602
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:37,290
We can help you,

603
00:30:38,830 --> 00:30:40,530
but you'd better keep your promise.

604
00:30:41,790 --> 00:30:44,620
The Huo Clan has its own acquisition channel

605
00:30:45,440 --> 00:30:47,490
that evades even Zhang Qishan's supervision.

606
00:30:48,590 --> 00:30:49,220
So,

607
00:30:49,590 --> 00:30:51,900
they kept providing supplies to us

608
00:30:52,510 --> 00:30:56,900
without anyone knowing.

609
00:31:12,510 --> 00:31:14,700
As I explored the tower,

610
00:31:15,350 --> 00:31:17,700
I found a crack on the mountain.

611
00:31:18,270 --> 00:31:19,860
It leads to the world outside.

612
00:31:20,830 --> 00:31:22,700
It's too small for a human to squeeze through,

613
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:26,660
but it's big enough for other things.

614
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:31,490
For example, Ding Qiansui can drop us supplies.

615
00:31:43,110 --> 00:31:43,570
Come.

616
00:31:46,830 --> 00:31:47,460
Keep up.

617
00:31:54,270 --> 00:31:55,180
Put it here.

618
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:55,700
Yes.

619
00:31:56,350 --> 00:31:57,490
With food,

620
00:31:57,880 --> 00:31:59,940
our living conditions underground stabilized.

621
00:32:00,480 --> 00:32:02,700
I knew I couldn't leave the tower this soon,

622
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:04,770
so I focused on the secrets of the tower.

623
00:32:05,680 --> 00:32:08,490
First, I studied all three of Yin Changsheng's spells.

624
00:32:09,070 --> 00:32:09,940
Then,

625
00:32:09,960 --> 00:32:12,010
I figured out the science behind the making of those monsters.

626
00:32:12,750 --> 00:32:13,860
Most importantly,

627
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:16,460
I found a pill.

628
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:19,330
Once taken, it makes your body mutate.

629
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:23,140
I tested it on my subordinate.

630
00:32:51,830 --> 00:32:54,330
And finally, we have a man

631
00:32:54,510 --> 00:32:55,940
who can climb the cliff

632
00:32:56,270 --> 00:32:57,730
to leave the Otherworld Tower.

633
00:33:23,680 --> 00:33:27,980
Ding Qiansui, these are the pills.

634
00:33:39,510 --> 00:33:43,940
I was stuck in the tower for three years.

635
00:33:48,270 --> 00:33:49,220
In these three years,

636
00:33:50,920 --> 00:33:52,090
I figured out

637
00:33:52,110 --> 00:33:53,810
almost all the secrets in this tower.

638
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:56,250
The Otherworld Tower

639
00:33:57,350 --> 00:33:59,380
is but a carefully designed

640
00:33:59,400 --> 00:34:00,620
scheme.

641
00:34:02,640 --> 00:34:04,570
As my research continued,

642
00:34:05,070 --> 00:34:06,290
I discovered that the Otherworld Tower

643
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:08,380
was just an entrance

644
00:34:09,190 --> 00:34:11,860
to a more mystical place.

645
00:34:15,230 --> 00:34:17,380
Is this a place accessible only

646
00:34:18,070 --> 00:34:19,260
through the underground streams?

647
00:34:19,800 --> 00:34:21,300
As expected of the Fifth Master.

648
00:34:23,030 --> 00:34:23,820
You're smart.

649
00:34:24,960 --> 00:34:25,530
Yes.

650
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:28,050
We travelled several hundred kilometers

651
00:34:28,590 --> 00:34:29,690
on the underground stream

652
00:34:30,400 --> 00:34:32,420
until we reached a hidden exit that leads

653
00:34:32,510 --> 00:34:33,260
to this place.

654
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:37,210
But this place isn't the destination

655
00:34:37,230 --> 00:34:37,980
of our trip.

656
00:34:38,880 --> 00:34:40,320
To reach the destination,

657
00:34:40,600 --> 00:34:41,650
we need your help.

658
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:43,380
So, I had no choice

659
00:34:43,890 --> 00:34:45,170
but to kidnap you.

660
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,780
But I couldn't do it in Changsha.

661
00:34:48,440 --> 00:34:49,900
That'd be too risky.

662
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:51,740
Therefore,

663
00:34:53,030 --> 00:34:54,940
you lured me to you.

664
00:34:55,880 --> 00:34:56,690
That's right.

665
00:34:57,550 --> 00:34:59,780
I had Ding Qiansui make an old stone tablet.

666
00:35:00,150 --> 00:35:02,340
Then, I bought several men on Unit 401

667
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:04,740
so that they could tell the rest to dig it.

668
00:35:05,070 --> 00:35:06,530
They would spread rumors

669
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:08,530
to compel the rest to join them.

670
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:11,610
The pills had already been ground

671
00:35:12,150 --> 00:35:14,010
and mixed with the soil.

672
00:35:15,230 --> 00:35:16,530
When they dug,

673
00:35:17,190 --> 00:35:18,490
mud would get on them.

674
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:20,210
They would be poisoned

675
00:35:21,040 --> 00:35:23,140
and become docile.

676
00:35:24,470 --> 00:35:25,900
Then, I had my men

677
00:35:26,150 --> 00:35:27,580
lead them to the Otherworld Tower

678
00:35:28,520 --> 00:35:30,020
to lure Zhang Qishan.

679
00:35:30,990 --> 00:35:31,540
And finally,

680
00:35:34,200 --> 00:35:35,020
you came.

681
00:35:36,710 --> 00:35:38,130
Why didn't you ask your men

682
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:40,260
to kidnap me right away?

683
00:35:41,590 --> 00:35:43,380
You think I've never tried that?

684
00:35:44,220 --> 00:35:49,700
[Wu's Residence]

685
00:36:09,590 --> 00:36:11,740
I know Zhang Qishan's and your capabilities very well.

686
00:36:12,630 --> 00:36:14,090
Once the Otherworld Tower became public,

687
00:36:14,670 --> 00:36:16,980
we only had one shot.

688
00:36:17,670 --> 00:36:19,260
So, I took a gamble.

689
00:36:23,110 --> 00:36:24,010
Why did you

690
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:26,460
let me perform those three spells?

691
00:36:29,760 --> 00:36:30,690
Don't pin that on me.

692
00:36:32,550 --> 00:36:35,130
I did not ask you to perform those three spells.

693
00:36:35,630 --> 00:36:37,490
It was all in your head.

694
00:36:38,030 --> 00:36:38,740
Oh, humans

695
00:36:39,150 --> 00:36:41,210
and their imagination.

696
00:36:41,840 --> 00:36:43,050
Be it spells

697
00:36:43,230 --> 00:36:44,490
or whatever wonderful thing

698
00:36:44,510 --> 00:36:45,720
in this world,

699
00:36:45,720 --> 00:36:47,820
they are all your imagination.

700
00:36:48,770 --> 00:36:50,620
So, I misjudged the situation.

701
00:36:52,110 --> 00:36:54,130
You did not force me to carry out the spells.

702
00:36:55,630 --> 00:36:56,860
It was all in my head.

703
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:02,260
What is wrong with you?

704
00:37:04,800 --> 00:37:06,490
Are you sure there were three spells?

705
00:37:08,550 --> 00:37:10,780
Are you sure you made a judgment?

706
00:37:11,150 --> 00:37:13,420
Are you sure there even are spells?

707
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:16,170
What do you mean?

708
00:37:16,630 --> 00:37:17,460
Explain now.

709
00:37:18,800 --> 00:37:20,570
The confusion you feel now

710
00:37:21,440 --> 00:37:24,130
is the effect of the secret.

711
00:37:25,230 --> 00:37:26,490
It is that secret

712
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:29,610
that makes the spells in the tower

713
00:37:29,670 --> 00:37:31,460
look so realistic.

714
00:37:32,230 --> 00:37:33,780
It makes everyone believe

715
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:36,900
that the Otherworld Patriarch used it to establish a cult,

716
00:37:37,190 --> 00:37:39,090
that Yin Changsheng was a real immortal.

717
00:37:39,400 --> 00:37:42,740
Their followers believed vehemently in their powers.

718
00:37:43,190 --> 00:37:46,090
You are a follower too.

719
00:37:47,630 --> 00:37:49,260
We, the Japanese, are always honest.

720
00:37:50,280 --> 00:37:50,860
Allow me

721
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:54,260
to tell you everything.

722
00:37:55,710 --> 00:37:56,530
A toast to me?

723
00:38:05,360 --> 00:38:06,170
Of course.

724
00:38:07,070 --> 00:38:08,530
Feel free to think of this

725
00:38:09,550 --> 00:38:11,130
as a victory lap.

726
00:38:13,400 --> 00:38:15,570
After all, my plan

727
00:38:15,710 --> 00:38:17,460
took three years to come to fruition.

728
00:38:19,190 --> 00:38:21,530
I studied you for three years.

729
00:38:22,230 --> 00:38:22,900
Fifth Master,

730
00:38:23,880 --> 00:38:24,530
I've been waiting

731
00:38:25,480 --> 00:38:26,860
for this moment.

732
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:30,420
Oh.

733
00:38:31,110 --> 00:38:32,820
The Huo Clan played a part in everything.

734
00:38:33,480 --> 00:38:35,170
Huo Xiangu isn't aware of it.

735
00:38:35,880 --> 00:38:36,900
But as the head of the clan,

736
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:40,130
if people find out that her clan is working with the Japanese,

737
00:38:40,590 --> 00:38:41,860
she will be held accountable.

738
00:38:42,760 --> 00:38:43,940
If you refuse to help me,

739
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:46,940
she won't die in our hands.

740
00:38:47,710 --> 00:38:50,900
She will die in the hands of the Ministry of War's Spy Execution Squad.

741
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:54,010
I know you still want to escape.

742
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:55,820
But at this point,

743
00:38:56,800 --> 00:38:59,570
you might as well tame that creature for me

744
00:39:00,550 --> 00:39:01,820
while you find an opportunity to escape.

745
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:03,490
Anyway.

746
00:39:04,510 --> 00:39:04,980
Mr. Wu.

747
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:06,860
Let's start tomorrow.

748
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:08,010
I'll count on you.

749
00:39:08,820 --> 00:39:11,340
[Li's Residence]

750
00:39:11,590 --> 00:39:13,490
My son, say "Father."

751
00:39:15,150 --> 00:39:17,340
Say "Father" and you'll have good food tonight.

752
00:39:18,800 --> 00:39:19,420
Say "Father."

753
00:39:19,710 --> 00:39:20,650
What is going on?

754
00:39:24,710 --> 00:39:25,610
Take him away and play with him.

755
00:39:26,590 --> 00:39:27,600
- Go play. - Go.

756
00:39:27,600 --> 00:39:28,310
- Come. - Go.

757
00:39:29,280 --> 00:39:30,960
- Go play now. - Go.

758
00:39:37,550 --> 00:39:39,210
How many times have I told you?

759
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:42,050
Don't teach him the wrong thing.

760
00:39:42,810 --> 00:39:44,150
[Fu Chunhua, Sister-in-law]
People will talk.

761
00:39:44,710 --> 00:39:45,740
So what?

762
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:48,130
My brother passed away many years ago.

763
00:39:49,400 --> 00:39:51,090
Your son is already this big,

764
00:39:51,230 --> 00:39:52,980
but you still refuse to move into this yard.

765
00:39:54,230 --> 00:39:55,860
What if people talk behind your back?

766
00:39:56,320 --> 00:39:57,210
I'm not afraid of that.

767
00:39:58,110 --> 00:39:59,340
I'm a woman.

768
00:39:59,360 --> 00:40:00,680
I hardly venture out.

769
00:40:00,680 --> 00:40:01,420
What's there to be afraid of?

770
00:40:02,110 --> 00:40:03,210
But you're different.

771
00:40:04,190 --> 00:40:06,010
You're Third Master of the Mystic Nine.

772
00:40:06,360 --> 00:40:07,210
And?

773
00:40:08,710 --> 00:40:09,980
I'm just an ordinary man.

774
00:40:10,590 --> 00:40:11,360
I have survived

775
00:40:11,360 --> 00:40:12,980
worse.

776
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:14,980
If you hadn't protected me back then,

777
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:16,260
I would have died in the ditch.

778
00:40:19,670 --> 00:40:21,300
Chunhua, what is bothering you?

779
00:40:23,670 --> 00:40:24,610
If you don't like my dirty deeds,

780
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:26,260
I can just retire now.

781
00:40:27,190 --> 00:40:29,010
Aren't you supposed to work with Master Zhang?

782
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:31,460
Pack up now.

783
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:33,380
See you.

784
00:40:46,190 --> 00:40:46,650
San'er.

785
00:40:47,960 --> 00:40:48,420
San'er.

786
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:51,300
Third Master.

787
00:40:51,670 --> 00:40:52,130
Come here.

788
00:40:53,630 --> 00:40:54,860
- Chunhua is... - Third Master.

789
00:40:55,400 --> 00:40:56,610
Don't you have a trip with Master Zhang?

790
00:40:57,000 --> 00:40:57,900
Let me pack your things.

791
00:41:10,100 --> 00:41:12,380
[Files]

792
00:41:40,110 --> 00:41:40,860
Impossible.

793
00:41:41,960 --> 00:41:43,530
No records on Ding Qiansui?

794
00:41:48,440 --> 00:41:49,980
He prospers in Changsha

795
00:41:50,360 --> 00:41:51,380
because he has support

796
00:41:51,400 --> 00:41:52,650
from the Americans.

797
00:42:00,630 --> 00:42:01,420
Bring Third Master over.

798
00:42:01,590 --> 00:42:02,050
Yes!

799
00:42:02,760 --> 00:42:03,210
Master.

800
00:42:05,190 --> 00:42:05,860
Third Master is here.

801
00:42:06,030 --> 00:42:06,780
He wants to see you by the entrance.

802
00:42:10,980 --> 00:42:15,580
[Changsha Defense Headquarters]

803
00:42:21,150 --> 00:42:21,690
Third Master.

804
00:42:23,190 --> 00:42:24,130
You're here, Master Zhang.

805
00:42:26,200 --> 00:42:26,820
Where are your men?

806
00:42:27,200 --> 00:42:27,780
On standby.

807
00:42:30,160 --> 00:42:31,490
That's all you're bringing?

808
00:42:32,270 --> 00:42:33,660
A few elite soldiers will do.

809
00:42:36,680 --> 00:42:38,250
I brought 300 men.

810
00:42:38,600 --> 00:42:39,290
That's a lot.

811
00:42:40,590 --> 00:42:41,920
It sure seems like it.

812
00:42:43,030 --> 00:42:43,530
What about this?

813
00:42:44,840 --> 00:42:45,690
Let's not bring anyone.

814
00:42:47,600 --> 00:42:48,210
For our peace.

815
00:42:55,870 --> 00:42:57,180
We're looking for an underground stream.

816
00:42:57,830 --> 00:42:58,860
So why are we going up to a mountain?

817
00:43:00,240 --> 00:43:01,860
Master Zhang, you are good at the arts of war.

818
00:43:02,520 --> 00:43:03,580
But you don't know geography well.

819
00:43:03,920 --> 00:43:05,940
The underground stream is an ancient waterway.

820
00:43:06,790 --> 00:43:08,500
The mountain layout has already changed,

821
00:43:10,320 --> 00:43:12,010
but there is an opening at the foot of the mountain.

822
00:43:12,240 --> 00:43:13,130
We can enter through it.

823
00:43:15,920 --> 00:43:17,580
How long will it take?

824
00:43:18,830 --> 00:43:19,860
Two to three days.

825
00:43:35,080 --> 00:43:35,730
I'm tired.

826
00:43:36,190 --> 00:43:37,060
Let's rest here.

827
00:43:49,190 --> 00:43:50,690
Will you push me off, Master Zhang?

828
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:52,050
No.

829
00:43:52,630 --> 00:43:53,210
Oh?

830
00:43:54,920 --> 00:43:56,740
Everyone in the Mystic Nine has done it,

831
00:43:57,230 --> 00:43:58,820
except you.

832
00:44:00,190 --> 00:44:01,460
Tiezui too?

833
00:44:02,670 --> 00:44:03,820
I looked at him in his eyes.

834
00:44:03,880 --> 00:44:05,130
He certainly thought about it.

835
00:44:06,070 --> 00:44:07,260
But unfortunately,

836
00:44:08,630 --> 00:44:09,900
his hands were too shaky.

837
00:44:12,000 --> 00:44:13,690
You're enjoying it, Third Master.

838
00:44:13,960 --> 00:44:14,570
No?

839
00:44:19,070 --> 00:44:20,690
I think my killer

840
00:44:21,070 --> 00:44:22,380
isn't born yet.

841
00:44:23,590 --> 00:44:24,820
The higher you climb,

842
00:44:25,400 --> 00:44:26,860
the harder you fall.

843
00:44:28,320 --> 00:44:29,260
But think about it.

844
00:44:30,190 --> 00:44:32,010
If you don't climb this high,

845
00:44:33,230 --> 00:44:34,610
you won't get

846
00:44:34,920 --> 00:44:36,650
a view this great.

847
00:44:37,280 --> 00:44:37,940
Don't you agree?

848
00:44:39,110 --> 00:44:40,570
Given your financial prowess,

849
00:44:41,360 --> 00:44:42,820
have you thought about retiring

850
00:44:43,480 --> 00:44:44,740
and living some peaceful days?

851
00:44:48,710 --> 00:44:50,530
The men behind me

852
00:44:50,710 --> 00:44:52,260
count on me to feed their tummies.

853
00:44:52,920 --> 00:44:53,490
And then,

854
00:44:55,190 --> 00:44:57,690
there are many more who want me dead.

855
00:44:59,670 --> 00:45:01,170
So if I

856
00:45:02,110 --> 00:45:03,300
retire,

857
00:45:03,840 --> 00:45:05,130
I won't even have to do much

858
00:45:05,630 --> 00:45:07,260
to meet my maker.

859
00:45:09,030 --> 00:45:09,530
Master Zhang,

860
00:45:10,670 --> 00:45:11,900
if you were me,

861
00:45:12,760 --> 00:45:13,570
would you retire?

862
00:45:20,030 --> 00:45:20,740
See?

863
00:45:21,800 --> 00:45:22,900
Don't think too far ahead.

864
00:45:23,360 --> 00:45:24,740
There's no point.

865
00:45:26,760 --> 00:45:29,050
The Japanese made a mess.

866
00:45:30,030 --> 00:45:31,610
Let's just figure out how to deal with them.

867
00:45:32,800 --> 00:45:34,420
I bet the Japanese would never see this coming,

868
00:45:35,000 --> 00:45:35,900
that one day,

869
00:45:36,280 --> 00:45:37,900
a cripple like me would be the one

870
00:45:37,920 --> 00:45:38,690
to stop them.

871
00:45:41,360 --> 00:45:42,780
Don't sell yourself short, Third Master.

872
00:45:43,840 --> 00:45:44,740
You've always

873
00:45:45,590 --> 00:45:48,050
been the purest among us in the Mystic Nine.

874
00:45:50,000 --> 00:45:53,490
The rest has changed more or less.

875
00:45:55,630 --> 00:45:57,210
I hope you can always

876
00:45:58,670 --> 00:45:59,490
stay true to yourself.

877
00:46:25,220 --> 00:46:29,380
♪The past fades like smoke♪

878
00:46:29,740 --> 00:46:32,460
♪A choice is made in silence♪

879
00:46:32,740 --> 00:46:35,540
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

880
00:46:35,940 --> 00:46:39,700
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

881
00:46:39,940 --> 00:46:43,380
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

882
00:46:43,660 --> 00:46:47,060
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

883
00:46:47,140 --> 00:46:54,420
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

884
00:46:54,860 --> 00:46:58,140
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

885
00:46:58,420 --> 00:47:01,660
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

886
00:47:01,820 --> 00:47:05,860
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

887
00:47:06,060 --> 00:47:09,420
♪Who believes in fate?♪

888
00:47:09,660 --> 00:47:13,020
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

889
00:47:13,260 --> 00:47:16,540
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

890
00:47:16,860 --> 00:47:20,540
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

891
00:47:20,740 --> 00:47:23,980
♪Take care♪

892
00:47:23,980 --> 00:47:26,540
♪We once raced♪

893
00:47:26,620 --> 00:47:28,540
♪For the dawn♪

894
00:47:28,700 --> 00:47:31,980
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

895
00:47:32,100 --> 00:47:35,380
♪In the web of fate♪

896
00:47:35,380 --> 00:47:38,580
♪No one can escape♪

897
00:47:39,580 --> 00:47:41,420
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

898
00:47:41,580 --> 00:47:43,140
♪We too were young once♪

899
00:47:43,220 --> 00:47:46,660
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

900
00:47:46,860 --> 00:47:49,180
♪Keep the ember lit♪

901
00:47:49,300 --> 00:47:53,820
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

902
00:47:53,940 --> 00:47:56,900
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

903
00:47:57,140 --> 00:48:00,660
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

904
